---
import SiteLayout from "../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Test checkout left"
  description="Leaving a test checkout does not prove a stock release."
  notFound
>
  <section class="wrap page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Stripe test flow — no real purchase</p>
    <h1>You left test checkout.</h1>
    <p>
      Returning here does not cancel an order, prove payment failed or release
      stock. A hold may remain until the provider confirms an expired, unpaid
      session and the server records that outcome.
    </p>
    <p>
      No real purchase or private order information is provided by this page.
    </p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/goods">
      Return to the collection
    </a>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
